{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Angry Youth</i> is a fighting game that takes place in the mid-1990s, inspired by games like <i>Virtua Fighter,</i> <i>Tekken </i>and<i> Fighting Vipers</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game takes place in 1995 in the city of Sancatown, where 6 boys, influenced by fighting video games, decide to hold a fighting tournament in the neighborhood where they live. Choose your fighter and let the fighting begin!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SIMPLE AND FUN GAMEPLAY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 PLAYABLE CHARACTERS, EACH ONE WITH THEIR OWN FIGHTING STYLE AND PERSONALITY</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 KINDS OF ARENAS</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 GAME MODES</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUARANTEED FUN FOR EVERYONE</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VIRTUA FIGHTER STYLE CONTROLS (GUARD-PUNCH-KICK)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672890?t=1747994448","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672890?t=1747994448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672890/339e54915286d210afe908c2475eeb62cac5ae03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747994448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672890/339e54915286d210afe908c2475eeb62cac5ae03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747994448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Share